  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Billy Greeting**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Lonesome River**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Don't Be Calling Me At 4 AM**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- ***Guitar Solo**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Alberta**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2026-02-11** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 157 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2026-02-11**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Recorded and seeded by Z-Man using Schoeps CCM4V microphones into a Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II at 48kHz/32-bit; Taped just in front of the FOH position, about 89 feet from the stage, with mics 8.5 feet high; Processed through Sound Forge 18 and CD Wave to 16-bit FLAC, tagged in Foobar2000; listed as show number 45 of 2026 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Zinevolthreads: [Billy Strings 2026 Tour Art Venue Poster By Fete Schaw At ExploreAshville Arena Asheville NC On February 13th 2026 Home ](https://shop.zinevolthreads.com/product/billy-strings-2026-tour-art-venue-poster-by-fete-schaw-at-exploreashville-arena-asheville-nc-on-february-13th-2026-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [3]\n- Poster by Fez Moreno: [Billy Strings Asheville North Carolina 2026 Night 2 Poster At Exploreasheville.com Arena On February 11 2026 Art By Fez ](https://blaxteeco.com/product/billy-strings-asheville-north-carolina-2026-night-2-poster-at-exploreasheville-com-arena-on-february-11-2026-art-by-fez-moreno-poster-canvas/) [4]\n- Poster by Zinevolthreads: [Billy Strings 2026 Tour Art Venue Poster By Fez Moreno At ExploreAshville Arena Asheville NC On February 11th 2026 Home ](https://shop.zinevolthreads.com/product/billy-strings-2026-tour-art-venue-poster-by-fez-moreno-at-exploreashville-arena-asheville-nc-on-february-11th-2026-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [5]",
